{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 10,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        35.701358795166016,
        218.8472137451172,
        53.701358795166016
      ],
      "text": "EXECUTIVE SUMMARY",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 18.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        66.27603149414062,
        399.7196044921875,
        75.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "The main purpose of these recommendations is to assist national and local public health",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546199798583984,
        78.27304077148438,
        399.6662902832031,
        87.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis (TB) control programmes in low- and middle-income countries to develop and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50120162963867,
        90.27005004882812,
        323.382080078125,
        99.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "implement case ﬁnding among people exposed to infectious cases of TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51020431518555,
        108.27005004882812,
        399.4137268066406,
        117.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "Systematic evaluation of people who have been exposed to potentially infectious cases of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.249202728271484,
        120.26705932617188,
        399.723388671875,
        129.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis (TB) can be an efﬁcient, targeted approach to intensiﬁed TB case ﬁnding that is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54951095581055,
        132.27304077148438,
        399.70550537109375,
        141.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "within the purview of TB control programmes. There are, however, no comprehensive global",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54050827026367,
        144.27005004882812,
        399.69622802734375,
        153.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for programmes. WHO, the International Union against Tuberculosis and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5315055847168,
        156.13079833984375,
        399.5255432128906,
        165.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "International Standards for Tuberculosis Care Lung Disease and the   all recommend that children",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.35151290893555,
        166.14474487304688,
        399.5882873535156,
        177.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "<  5 years of age and persons living with HIV (PLHIV) who are exposed to infectious cases of",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.42351150512695,
        180.26107788085938,
        399.66058349609375,
        189.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "TB be evaluated for active TB and considered for treatment of latent tuberculosis infection",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.486515045166016,
        192.27304077148438,
        399.7164611816406,
        201.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "(LTBI) if active TB is excluded. With these exceptions, there are no recommendations at global",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55160140991211,
        204.27005004882812,
        72.86360168457031,
        213.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "level to:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55160140991211,
        222.27005004882812,
        399.72528076171875,
        231.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "• deﬁne the epidemiological and programme conditions under which contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05659866333008,
        234.26705932617188,
        97.64959716796875,
        243.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "is indicated;",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55160140991211,
        252.26705932617188,
        349.8924560546875,
        261.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "• describe TB index patients on whom contact investigation should be focused;",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.56959915161133,
        268.1566162109375,
        399.7311096191406,
        279.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "< • identify TB contacts who should be investigated (other than children   5 years of age and",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.071102142333984,
        282.27294921875,
        399.73095703125,
        291.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV); and recommend the procedures to be used for identifying, screening and tracking",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.06209945678711,
        294.26995849609375,
        97.64608764648438,
        303.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "TB contacts.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.566097259521484,
        312.26995849609375,
        399.7669372558594,
        321.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "The following recommendations are based on recent systematic reviews of the literature on",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.59309768676758,
        324.2669677734375,
        399.7582092285156,
        333.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation in low- and middle-income countries. The reviews are summarized in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5840950012207,
        336.26397705078125,
        105.01708984375,
        345.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "annexes 1 and 2.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5840950012207,
        354.1277160644531,
        386.07098388671875,
        363.13958740234375
      ],
      "text": "Note: The deﬁnitions in Section 4 should be read to fully understand the recommendations.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52309799194336,
        372.2758483886719,
        399.71484375,
        381.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations were prepared following the WHO procedures for guideline",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55009841918945,
        384.2728576660156,
        399.7508239746094,
        393.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "development. A steering committee consisting of Stop TB Department staff met twice to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.58610153198242,
        396.2698669433594,
        400.10205078125,
        405.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "determine the scope of the document, to identify relevant questions and to review the plan.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55910110473633,
        408.2668762207031,
        400.04827880859375,
        417.2668762207031
      ],
      "text": "A guideline development group (GDG) consisting of experts in relevant areas was selected.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50510025024414,
        420.2638854980469,
        399.6763610839844,
        429.275634765625
      ],
      "text": "Additional input was provided by an external stakeholders group. All GDG members and the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51140213012695,
        432.27264404296875,
        399.6671447753906,
        441.27264404296875
      ],
      "text": "external reviewers, who provided comments on the document, completed and signed the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50239944458008,
        444.2696228027344,
        281.9024353027344,
        453.2696228027344
      ],
      "text": "WHO form on conﬂict of interest. No conﬂicts were identiﬁed.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5203971862793,
        474.0959167480469,
        399.67620849609375,
        483.2666320800781
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1 It is recommended that contact investigation be conducted for house -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55239868164062,
        486.2636413574219,
        399.6763610839844,
        495.2636413574219
      ],
      "text": "hold and close contacts when the index case has any of the following",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54339599609375,
        498.2606201171875,
        187.492431640625,
        507.2606201171875
      ],
      "text": "characteristics:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54339599609375,
        516.2606811523438,
        300.5652770996094,
        525.2786254882812
      ],
      "text": "• has sputum smear-positive pulmonary TB,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56730651855469,
        534.2747802734375,
        379.2522277832031,
        543.2747802734375
      ],
      "text": "• has multi-drug-resistant TB (MDR-TB or extremely-resistant TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.081298828125,
        546.2717895507812,
        258.56231689453125,
        555.2717895507812
      ],
      "text": "(XDR-TB) (proven or suspected),",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58529663085938,
        564.2717895507812,
        183.7183074951172,
        573.2717895507812
      ],
      "text": "• is a PLHIV or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58529663085938,
        580.1524658203125,
        235.3963623046875,
        591.2717895507812
      ],
      "text": "< • is a child   5 years of age.",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59429931640625,
        600.2717895507812,
        324.80224609375,
        609.2717895507812
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        219.03179931640625,
        651.97265625,
        223.17930603027344,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "8",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}